OL,3,GNEWSALynx and wolfdog sanctuary plan
OL,4,Afor former gin distillery
OL,5,
OL,6,FPlans have been lodged to turn the site
OL,7,Fof a former gin distillery in southern
OL,8,FScotland into a home for exotic
OL,9,Fanimals.
OL,11,FThe Eclipse Animal Sanctuary (EAS)
OL,12,Fwants to convert the site at Dalton in
OL,13,FDumfries and Galloway to house a
OL,14,Fvariety of species including a wolfdog,
OL,15,Flynx, turkey vulture and an American
OL,16,Fred fox.
OL,18,FAn application said the small-scale
OL,19,Fdevelopment would cater for about 20
OL,20,Frescue animals alongside eight pet
OL,21,Fdogs.
OL,23,APub: 24-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  Scot NewsC Reg TVF  Weather
FL,430,420,260,160,0,100
